Package: heartfill
Title: Novelty Fill Patterns (Hearts, Stars, Flowers, Butterflies, Cats, Dogs, Unicorns,
    Sugar Beets, Computers) for 'ggplot2' Plots
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Alexander", "Molin", email = "alexander.karl.molin@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Adds new fill patterns (hearts, stars, flowers, butterflies, cats, dogs, unicorns,
    sugar beets, computers) to 'ggpattern'
    geoms such as geom_col_pattern() and geom_bar_pattern().
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: grid, gridpattern
Suggests: ggplot2, ggpattern
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
